;Description
:This template is used to link to an koebu song page.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{Koebu|<koeid>}}</nowiki></code> and substitute <koeid> with the latter part of the koebu song link. If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.

;Example<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:<pre>{{Koebu|b32a341f7f8f803d9b2f1645b240f16b3649d0ab|soraru's Natsu no Hi to, Yuurei to, Kamisama cover on Koebu description}}</pre>

;Will result in<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Koebu|b32a341f7f8f803d9b2f1645b240f16b3649d0ab|soraru's Natsu no Hi to, Yuurei to, Kamisama cover on Koebu description}}

;note<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:description field is optional.

